== Notes ==
* Cannot be used while in combat.
* Using the Tome of Knowledge will grant the character the amount of experience required to gain one level and all associated benefits. It keeps your level progression (ex. if a character is level n with 42 exp and uses the tome, they will go to level n+1 with 42 exp.

